<section class="shipping-page section-pad">
  <div class="shipping-page__intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Delivery</p>
    <h1>Shipping &amp; delivery</h1>
    <p>We deliver across Egypt door to door. Your shipping fee is calculated by destination zone at checkout.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="shipping-table-wrap">
    <table class="shipping-table">
      <caption>Standard delivery rates in Egyptian pounds</caption>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Zone</th><th scope="col">First delivery</th><th scope="col">Return / cancellation</th><th scope="col">Exchange</th><th scope="col">First attempt</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">1 · Greater Cairo</th><td>LE 65</td><td>LE 55</td><td>LE 98</td><td>1 working day</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">2 · Alexandria</th><td>LE 68</td><td>LE 58</td><td>LE 102</td><td>1–2 working days</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">3 · Delta &amp; Canal</th><td>LE 76</td><td>LE 66</td><td>LE 114</td><td>1–3 working days</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">4 · Upper Egypt 1</th><td>LE 86</td><td>LE 76</td><td>LE 129</td><td>2–4 working days</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">5 · Upper Egypt 2 &amp; Red Sea</th><td>LE 89</td><td>LE 79</td><td>LE 134</td><td>3–5 working days</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">6 · Remote areas</th><td>LE 104</td><td>LE 94</td><td>LE 156</td><td>5 working days</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="shipping-notes">
    <article><h2>What is included</h2><p>Door-to-door delivery throughout Egypt, cash collection, and validation for shipments not delivered after the first attempt.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Rate notes</h2><p>Rates cover the first 2 kg and are shown before the applicable 14% VAT. Each additional kilogram is charged by zone from LE 5 to LE 10.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Order value</h2><p>Rates cover orders up to LE 3,000. Orders above LE 3,000 incur 1% on the amount above LE 3,000.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Shipping information"}
{% endschema %}
